{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07545","headline":"咏史十一首 七 · 李华","name":"咏史十一首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天生忠与义，本以佐雍熙。\n何意李司隶，而当昏乱时。\n古坟襄城野，斜径横秋陂。\n况不禁樵采，茅莎无孑遗。\n高标尚可仰，精爽今何之。\n一忤中常侍，衔冤谁见知。\n尝观党锢传，抚卷不胜悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}